OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and sunny throughout the
OL,6,Fday, with variable amounts of high,
OL,7,Fwispy cloud, but otherwise mostly
OL,8,Fclear skies. Feeling warm, perhaps
OL,9,Fvery warm, in the sunshine. Winds
OL,10,Fremaining light throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly clear going into the
OL,13,Fevening, but cloud likely building
OL,14,Facross northern and western areas.
OL,15,FElsewhere, a few mist and fog patches
OL,16,Fmay form in any clear spells overnight.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FDry with variable cloud on
OL,19,FTuesday, along with some bright or
OL,20,Fsunny spells. Feeling warm or very
OL,21,Fwarm in any sunshine, with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
